# mod-reagent-bank MPQ overlay manifest
#
# Hashes are UNSET until packaging is run against the recorded client baseline:
#   Turtle client 1.18.1.7272 + 2026-04-12 hotfix set
#
# Format: <SHA-256 hex>  <path>
# Placeholder token UNSET means packaging MUST NOT release until replaced.
#
# Packaging MUST fail if:
#   - any line still contains UNSET;
#   - extracted baseline CharacterFrame.xml does not match CharacterFrame.xml.original; or
#   - archive listing or file hashes do not match this manifest.
# The packaging script also requires --baseline-sha256 and rejects mismatches
# between that explicit value and CharacterFrame.xml.original.

# Baseline CharacterFrame.xml (before loader line)
# TODO: populate after first extract from 1.18.1.7272 + 2026-04-12 hotfix set
UNSET  CharacterFrame.xml.original

# Patched CharacterFrame.xml (baseline + <Script file="ModReagentBank.lua"/>)
# TODO: populate after applying the one-line loader patch
UNSET  CharacterFrame.xml.patched

# Overlay files (paths relative to mpq-overlay/)
UNSET  Interface/FrameXML/ModReagentBank.lua
# marble.blp is an explicit external packaging input; pin its exact source hash.
UNSET  Interface/FrameXML/ModReagentBank/textures/marble.blp
UNSET  Interface/FrameXML/CharacterFrame.xml

# Final assembled MPQ (dev artifact name; production may differ)
# TODO: populate after MPQ build and listing inspection
UNSET  mod-reagent-bank-dev.mpq
